                        "glosses": [
                            "Relating to or characteristic of a granddaughter."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa1b409e-81a9-4575-8f4a-679517dae903",
                                "sense_id": "cfb25493-16d0-3648-8fe4-fb6b78f698f4",
                                "text": "Our excursion to Topsham would, we supposed, prove a very disagreeable business to him; but we knew it would result very agreeably for us, and so, though with a good deal of maidenly compunction and granddaughterly compassion on Julia’s part, we out[-]voted him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c78c9ee-a36c-4cfb-9aec-38c33cbb2f02",
                                "sense_id": "cfb25493-16d0-3648-8fe4-fb6b78f698f4",
                                "text": "Mabel had gone (it was a small service of granddaughterly duty, that had from long habit become an institution at Castle Roy) to her grandfather’s sanctum, with a cup of the beverage he loved, namely, a half cupful of weak green tea, filled to the brim with clotted cream."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3b1c827-7839-4e7a-8932-85ab7821635d",
                                "sense_id": "cfb25493-16d0-3648-8fe4-fb6b78f698f4",
                                "text": "I don’t think she can really care for him, except just in a grand[-]daughterly (what a horrid word to write!) sort of way."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ade58387-9509-420b-9877-e4bb138db3c0",
                                "sense_id": "cfb25493-16d0-3648-8fe4-fb6b78f698f4",
                                "text": "But I felt I was missing something, a link to the older generation. I thought it would be nice to have an elder to talk to, someone who could lay a little life wisdom on me as I reciprocated with granddaughterly attentions."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
